# Gadget designs/gadgets/scaffold-delay (ScaffoldingBlock: any shape update schedules a tick 1 gt later; the tick recomputes distance and setBlockAndUpdate, whose onPlace schedules another tick). Breaking W: A turns distance 1 (bottom) at tick 1, C at tick 2, the observer on C pulses 2 gt later; W back: A 0 at tick 1, C 0 at tick 2, a second pulse.
box -1 -1 -1 2 4 1
block 0 0 0 minecraft:stone
block 1 0 0 minecraft:stone
block 0 1 0 minecraft:scaffolding[bottom=false,distance=0,waterlogged=false]
block 1 1 0 minecraft:scaffolding[bottom=false,distance=0,waterlogged=false]
block 0 2 0 minecraft:scaffolding[bottom=false,distance=0,waterlogged=false]
block 0 3 0 minecraft:observer[facing=down,powered=false]
run 4
set 0 0 0 minecraft:air
run 8
set 0 0 0 minecraft:stone
run 8
